# Tannuk, Steadfast Second: "Red creature cards in your hand have warp {2}{R}" (CR 702.185a, 113.6). Bot1 casts Tannuk
# (Black Lotus and a Mox Ruby), then Hill Giant ({3}{R}) for the warp Tannuk gives: with two Mox Rubies it is not offered
# (and would be with more mana), with a third it is, so the cost is {2}{R} exactly. "Other creatures you control have haste":
# the Giant attacks at once for 3. At the beginning of the end step warp exiles it, and on Bot1's next turn it is cast from
# exile for its mana cost (CR 702.185a), staying.

